#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry angle. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Variable R : realType. (* Let points correspond to their labels in the diagram *) Variables A B C D E F G H I J K L : R^2. Hypotheses (hABF : colinear A B F) (hDF : colinear D F H) (hLGH : colinear L G H) (hJB : colinear J B K) (hDE : colinear D E I) (hCJ : colinear C B J) (hB_on_AB : between A B F) (hD_on_DF : between D F H) (hBJ : between B J K) (hDG : between D G I) (hJG_on_LH : between L J G) (hJG_on_LG : between L G H) (h_parallel_AB_DF : parallel [line A, B] [line D, F]) (h_parallel_DF_LGH : parallel [line D, F] [line L, G]). Lemma intersection_props : colinear B D G. Proof. by apply: parallel_trans h_parallel_AB_DF h_parallel_DF_LGH. Qed. End.
